  "limitations": [
    "Local Docker Linux VM, synthetic 720p30 H.264, one-second MediaMTX idle grace, producer HTTP endpoint already available; Next.js authorization and physical target are excluded.",
    "Three startup cycles and four programmatic initial-POST cancellations; no percentile or reliability guarantee.",
    "Every stop result is observed, and source/session counters are sampled for 18 seconds after the close promise settles, beyond the 15-second MediaMTX setup timeout.",
    "Resource-observation times start after close settles, not at the user stop action; close duration is retained separately. Roughly 100ms sampling brackets state transitions, without cross-host clock claims.",
    "Cycles retain one shared producer session on warm reopen/join and zero allocated sources after the final reader idle grace. This is not a sustained latency, encoding CPU peak or impaired-network qualification.",
    "The runner is still a private pilot whose hash is retained; its portable qualification integration remains pending."
